Subject: Preserve OpenMANET radio and SPI board integration on MM6108 2.2.2

Rebase regulatory discovery, AP/STA, VIF, channel flag, SPI timing and
optional FEM GPIO support. Use device-managed FEM GPIO ownership in SPI
probe so failed probes and removal release it without double-free.
Keep upstream bus probe ordering for disabled SDIO/USB frontends.

